I am home now.
Here is my room.
It is a small room.
I have a new plant.
It stands on my desk.
It is evening, and it is January.
My window is very dark.
It is completely black outside.
I have a lamp and a cup of tea.
I turn on my lamp.
Now my room is warm and bright.
My tea is also warm.
I sit at my desk.
I have my computer here.
I open my computer.
Now I call my family in Mexico.
I am very happy.
